      "name": "Api",
      "kind": 1,
      "source": "Public Function RunProbe() As String\r\n    Dim ws As Object, data() As Double\r\n    Set ws = ThisWorkbook.Worksheets(1)\r\n    ReDim Preserve data(2 To 3, 4 To 5)\r\n    data(2, 4) = 1.25\r\n    data(2, 5) = 2.5\r\n    data(3, 4) = 3.75\r\n    data(3, 5) = 5#\r\n    ReDim Preserve data(2 To 3, 4 To 6)\r\n    ws.Range(\"A1:C2\").Value = data\r\n    ReDim data(1 To 1, 1 To 1)\r\n    ws.Range(\"E1\").Value2 = data(1, 1)\r\n    RunProbe = \"ok\"\r\nEnd Function\r\n",
      "source_sha256": "sha256:354bc1bae51b5d0f865d788e470ebec0e976bf392d24b561236cca636b6fdecf",
